==Battleground==
*3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Tackey]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**6 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring meatshields, a few critical chance up combos such as [[Miracle Performance (Combo)|Miracle Performance]] along with 1-2 critters, and a couple of anti-Dark/wave units. Abuse the Metal Hippoes at the start to stack your attackers like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]/talented [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]], as well as [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Hermit]]/[[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]]. You should accumulate enough DPS to kill the ensuing swarm of enemies (Tackey isn't a threat as most units you bring likely have low range), and send your critters to kill off the Super Metal Hippoe.

